\" Version: 1.2
.\"
.TH SAPHanaSR-tester.sudo 5 "04 Nov 2026" "" "SAPHanaSR-angi"
.\"
.SH NAME
.\"
SAPHanaSR-tester.sudo \- sudo permissions for SAPHanaSR-tester.
.PP
.\"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.\"
SAPHanaSR-tester.sudo describes sudo permissions needed on cluster nodes, if
SAPHanaSR-testCluster logs in as non-root user.
<\fIsidadm\fR> is <sid>adm, <\fISID\fR> is SID (uppercase), <\fIsid\fR> is sid
(lowercase), <\fINR\fR> is instance number.
.PP
.RS 2
<\fIsidadm\fR> ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD: /usr/bin/SAPHanaSR-hookHelper --sid=<\fISID\fR> *
.br
<\fIsidadm\fR> ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD: /usr/sbin/SAPHanaSR-hookHelper --sid=<\fISID\fR> *
.br
<\fIsidadm\fR> ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD: /usr/sbin/crm_attribute -n hana_<\fIsid\fR>_*
.br
<\fIsidadm\fR> ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD: /usr/bin/SAPHanaSR-showAttr *
.br
<\fIsidadm\fR> ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD: /usr/sbin/crm --force node fence *
.br
<\fIsidadm\fR> ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD: /usr/sap/<\fISID\fR>/HDB<\fINR\fR>/HDB *
.br
<\fIsidadm\fR> ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD: /usr/sap/<\fISID\fR>/HDB<\fINR\fR>/exe/hdbnsutil *
.br
<\fIsidadm\fR> ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD: /usr/bin/systemctl *
.RE
.PP
Note: Permissions might be granted more granular, if needed.
.PP
.\"
.SH EXAMPLES
.\"
.PP
\fB*\fP Show SAPHanaSR-tester.sudo example.
.PP
.RS 2
# cat /usr/SAPHanaSR-tester/samples/SAPHanaSR-tester.sudo
.RE
.PP
\fB*\fP Copy SAPHanaSR-tester.sudo to cluster nodes.
.PP
Example nodes are 'nose1' and 'nose2'.
.PP
.RS 2
# scp /usr/SAPHanaSR-tester/samples/SAPHanaSR-tester.sudo \\
.br
 nose1:/etc/sudoers.d/SAPHanaSR-tester
.br
# scp /usr/SAPHanaSR-tester/samples/SAPHanaSR-tester.sudo \\
.br
 nose1:/etc/sudoers.d/SAPHanaSR-tester
.RE
.PP
.\"
.SH FILES
.\"
.TP
/usr/SAPHanaSR-tester/samples/SAPHanaSR-tester.sudo
example for sudoers permissions, on test controller
.TP
/etc/sudoers.d/SAPHanaSR-tester
effective sudoers file on cluster nodes
.PP
.\"
.\"
.SH REQUIREMENTS
.\"
\fB*\fR root permission is needed on the cluster nodes to put the file there.
.PP
\fB*\fR If permission are granted more granular, the customer needs to make sure
the tester still will work.
.PP
See also the REQUIREMENTS section in SAPHanaSR-tester(7).
.PP
